WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.920
An intervening canopy can prevent valid sukkah

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:03.240
dwelling.

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:06.300
Remove the obstacle in advance, like removing

00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:08.260
a cue that repeatedly disrupts a useful

00:00:08.260 --> 00:00:08.740
routine.
